body: "Overlap audit: inspected core SDK deadline and context relevance contracts, pm-context deadline rendering, pm-ops lifecycle policy, pm-review and existing pm-memory recall/verification. Deadlines schedule work; no matching truth-validity or renewal feature found. Reuse pm-memory pins, ranking, process writer lock, native fields and append-only item history. Builds on semantic recall PR #5 and must merge after it."
